B.acI=new A.jq("The Anatomy Lab lets you explore body systems in 3D, rotate and zoom the model, and practice identification.",B.a6S)
B.acJ=new A.jq("AI Study can turn your notes or supported files into practice questions and flashcards grounded in your source.",B.xF)
